@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title US009 - To create a library

box #LightYellow
actor User
participant ":MiteLovers" as UI
end box

' Interactions
User -> UI : I want to create a library
activate UI
UI --> User : What's the library's name?
User -> UI : myFirstLib
UI --> User : Okay, your library was created!
deactivate UI



@enduml